{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":9,"ref":"2-chronicles 30:9","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"id","chapter":30,"translation":"Sebab pada kesialan kalian kepada Yahweh, saudara-saudara kalian dan anak-anak kalian ⟨akan mendapat⟩ belas kasihan di hadapan orang-orang yang menawan mereka, dan mereka akan kembali ke tanah ini, sebab penuh kasih dan penuh rahmat ⟨adalah⟩ Yahweh, Elohim kalian, dan tidak akan Ia menalingpkan wajah dari kalian, jika kalian kembali kepada-Nya.","tokens":[{"surface":"כי","gloss":"sebab"},{"surface":"בשובכם","gloss":"pada kesialan kalian"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"kepada"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"Yahweh"},{"surface":"אחיכם","gloss":"saudara-saudara kalian"},{"surface":"ובניכם","gloss":"dan anak-anak kalian"},{"surface":"לרחמים","gloss":"untuk belas kasihan"},{"surface":"לפני","gloss":"di hadapan"},{"surface":"שוביהם","gloss":"orang-orang yang menawan mereka"},{"surface":"ולשוב","gloss":"dan untuk kembali"},{"surface":"לארץ","gloss":"ke tanah"},{"surface":"הזאת","gloss":"ini"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"sebab"},{"surface":"חנון","gloss":"penuh kasih"},{"surface":"ורחום","gloss":"dan penuh rahmat"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"Yahweh"},{"surface":"אלהיכם","gloss":"Elohim kalian"},{"surface":"ולא","gloss":"dan tidak"},{"surface":"יסיר","gloss":"Ia akan memalingkan"},{"surface":"פנים","gloss":"wajah"},{"surface":"מכם","gloss":"dari kalian"},{"surface":"אם","gloss":"jika"},{"surface":"תשובו","gloss":"kalian kembali"},{"surface":"אליו","gloss":"kepada-Nya"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-08T12:08:50.367347316Z","model":"glm-5.2"}